    "Apple Intelligence manages this model's preparation, storage and removal in system Settings. DoodleNote never silently sends requests to a cloud model.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "comment": "App-owned UI. Non-English translations are machine drafts; qualified human review pending.",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Apple Intelligence manages this model's preparation, storage and removal in system Settings. DoodleNote never silently sends requests to a cloud model."
          }
        },
        "da": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Apple Intelligence styrer forberedelse, lagring og fjernelse af denne model i systemindstillingerne. DoodleNote sender aldrig forespørgsler til en cloudmodel uden dit vidende."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Apple Intelligence gestiona la preparación, el almacenamiento y la eliminación de este modelo en Ajustes. DoodleNote nunca envía solicitudes a un modelo en la nube sin avisar."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Apple Intelligence gère la préparation, le stockage et la suppression de ce modèle dans les réglages système. DoodleNote n’envoie jamais de requêtes à un modèle cloud à votre insu."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Apple Intelligence verwaltet Vorbereitung, Speicherung und Entfernung dieses Modells in den Systemeinstellungen. DoodleNote sendet niemals unbemerkt Anfragen an ein Cloud-Modell."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Apple is preparing the generation model. Check Apple Intelligence in system Settings.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "comment": "App-owned UI. Non-English translations are machine drafts; qualified human review pending.",
