    "Trash retains notes and local audio for 30 days. Expired local items are removed when DoodleNote next runs. This does not erase exported backups or devices that are powered off.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "comment": "App-owned UI. Non-English translations are machine drafts; qualified human review pending.",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Trash retains notes and local audio for 30 days. Expired local items are removed when DoodleNote next runs. This does not erase exported backups or devices that are powered off."
          }
        },
        "da": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Papirkurven bevarer noter og lokal lyd i 30 dage. Udløbne lokale elementer fjernes, næste gang DoodleNote kører. Dette sletter ikke eksporterede sikkerhedskopier eller data på slukkede enheder."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "La papelera conserva notas y audio local durante 30 días. Los elementos vencidos se eliminan cuando DoodleNote vuelve a ejecutarse. Esto no borra copias exportadas ni dispositivos apagados."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "La corbeille conserve les notes et l’audio local pendant 30 jours. Les éléments expirés sont supprimés au prochain lancement de DoodleNote. Cela n’efface ni les sauvegardes exportées ni les appareils éteints."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Der Papierkorb bewahrt Notizen und lokales Audio 30 Tage lang auf. Abgelaufene lokale Einträge werden beim nächsten Start von DoodleNote entfernt. Exportierte Sicherungen und ausgeschaltete Geräte werden nicht gelöscht."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Type with the keyboard or write with Apple Pencil using system Scribble. Saved drawings are not converted automatically.": {
